<title>SINGAPORE: Hewlett-Packard in Singapore electronics jv.</title>
<headline>Hewlett-Packard in Singapore electronics jv.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chartered Semiconductor Manufacturing, a unit of state-owned Singapore Technologies, said on Thursday it formed a joint venture with Hewlett-Packard Co to make high-technology electronic circuits in Singapore.</p>
</text>
